# Preserve reviewed bytes in the index, clones and GitHub source archives.
# Frozen inputs include LF, CRLF and binary assets. Git must not normalize them.
# Unity .lighting is published as LF; do not convert it or other frozen assets.
* -text

# Never run binary assets through end-of-line conversion.
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.fbx binary
*.gif binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.ogg binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.psd binary
*.tga binary
*.ttf binary
*.wav binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
